---
description: C++ style for this repo
globs: "**/*.{h,cpp}"
alwaysApply: false
---

- C++17, 4 spaces, Allman braces; `.clang-format` is authoritative (`scripts/format.sh`).
- Shared code lives in `animalaudio::dsp` / `animalaudio::ui`; each plugin has its own lowercase namespace.
- `shared/ui` is an INTERFACE library (sources compile into each plugin); do not make it a STATIC lib linking JUCE modules.
- Parameter IDs and plugin codes are part of saved-state compatibility; never rename them after release.
- Comments only for non-obvious intent or constraints; never narrate the code.
